{"title":"할아버지에게 받은 논에서 석유가 터졌다","thumbnail":"https://dn-img-page.kakao.com/download/resource?kid=bkI7aT/dJMcafHrzeW/EwiNLQexRaxR3PnrANDoLK&filename=th3","synopsis":"할아버지가 논밭을 주고 가셨다.\n그런데 논밭이 뭔가 이상하다.\n파보니까 석유가 나온다.","topComments":[{"date":"26.07.23","text":"대한민국은 광업권은 땅 소유자에게 있지 않고 나라에 있음.\n어찌 글을 쓰려나","episode":"할아버지에게 받은 논에서 석유가 터졌다 1화","likeCount":"1","replyCount":"댓글 달기"},{"date":"26.08.01","text":"동녘 유전이였다가 에너지였다가\n부모가 두집인가? 오락가락하시네요","episode":"할아버지에게 받은 논에서 석유가 터졌다 28화","likeCount":"좋아요","replyCount":"댓글 달기"},{"date":"26.07.23","text":"이 작가도 글 갑깁하게 쓰는데 소질있네 노인 양반들에게 미리  이렇게 할겁니다 하면서 절대 계약서 같은거 못쓰게 하먼 되지 무조건 외지인 만나지 마라 뭔 개 소 리  냐  그리곤 일 생기니 마을 위하는척","episode":"할아버지에게 받은 논에서 석유가 터졌다 15화","likeCount":"좋아요","replyCount":"댓글 달기"}],"commentKeywords":[],"rankSeries":{"daily":[],"weekly":[],"monthly":[{"date":"2026-08-09","rank":210,"change":{"type":"up","amount":8}},{"date":"2026-08-10","rank":206,"change":{"type":"up","amount":4}},{"date":"2026-08-11","rank":206,"change":{"type":"same","amount":null}},{"date":"2026-08-12","rank":207,"change":{"type":"down","amount":1}},{"date":"2026-08-13","rank":206,"change":{"type":"up","amount":1}},{"date":"2026-08-14","rank":202,"change":{"type":"up","amount":4}},{"date":"2026-08-15","rank":202,"change":{"type":"same","amount":null}},{"date":"2026-08-16","rank":199,"change":{"type":"up","amount":3}},{"date":"2026-08-17","rank":196,"change":{"type":"up","amount":3}},{"date":"2026-08-18","rank":197,"change":{"type":"down","amount":1}},{"date":"2026-08-19","rank":193,"change":{"type":"up","amount":4}},{"date":"2026-08-20","rank":192,"change":{"type":"up","amount":1}},{"date":"2026-08-21","rank":189,"change":{"type":"up","amount":3}},{"date":"2026-08-22","rank":234,"change":{"type":"down","amount":45}},{"date":"2026-08-23","rank":277,"change":{"type":"down","amount":43}}]},"viewSeries":[],"metricsSeries":[{"date":"2026-10-07","v":37345,"rc":78,"rs":700,"cc":20},{"date":"2026-10-08","v":37403,"rc":78,"rs":700,"cc":20},{"date":"2026